{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:98606","published":"2026-11-16T18:06:44.750136Z","modified":"2026-11-16T18:30:02.720964400Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-89058","CVE-2026-89059","CVE-2026-89407","CVE-2026-89425","CVE-2026-91777"],"summary":"Important: dogtag-pki security update","details":"IdM PKI is an enterprise software system designed to manage enterprise Public Key Infrastructure deployments.  IdM PKI consists of the following components: \n  * Certificate Authority (CA)\n  * Key Recovery Authority (KRA)\n  * Online Certificate Status Protocol (OCSP) Manager\n  * Token Key Service (TKS)\n  * Token Processing Service (TPS)\n  * Automatic Certificate Management Environment (ACME) Responder\n  * Enrollment over Secure Transport (EST) Responder\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* resteasy-core: RESTEasy: IIOImageProvider Unbounded Image Decode (Decompression-Bomb DoS) (CVE-2026-89059)\n\n* resteasy-core: RESTEasy: CorsFilter Reflects Arbitrary Origin with Credentials under Wildcard Config (CVE-2026-89058)\n\n* com.fasterxml.jackson/jackson-core: tools.jackson.core/jackson-core: Jackson-core: Denial of Service via regular expression backtracking (CVE-2026-89407)\n\n* com.fasterxml.jackson.core/jackson-core: Jackson-core: Denial of Service via unbounded StringBuilder growth during malformed token processing (CVE-2026-89425)\n\n* com.fasterxml.jackson.core/jackson-databind: tools.jackson.core:jackson-databind: Jackson-databind: Denial of Service via quadratic forward-reference completion (CVE-2026-91777)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"idm-pki-tools-debuginfo","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-linux/idm-pki-tools-debuginfo?distro=rocky-linux-10&epoch=0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0:11.9.0-9.el10_3.1.rocky.0.1"}],"database_spec